flowchart TD
  REQUIREMENT[Identify the user and workload] --> CONSTRAINTS[Record privacy, latency, distribution and cost constraints]
  CONSTRAINTS --> OPTIONS[Compare current stack and alternatives]
  OPTIONS --> MEASURE[Prototype and measure the actual bottleneck]
  MEASURE --> CHOOSE[Record decision and consequences]
  CHOOSE --> VERIFY[Validate correctness and operational cost]
  VERIFY --> REVIEW{Have the assumptions changed?}
  REVIEW -->|No| KEEP[Keep the simpler working design]
  REVIEW -->|Yes| OPTIONS
